        "node_id": "n_1_d88f16",
        "thought_text": "Dynamic Programming Approach with Correct Initialization and State Transition\n\nInitialize the DP table correctly to handle all possible states of warriors and castles. Ensure state transitions account for capturing, defending, and using portals efficiently.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
