      "rev_n_2_f7bfab_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_f7bfab_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_f7bfab",
        "thought_text": "Dynamic Programming Approach with Memoization\n\nConsider using dynamic programming with memoization to keep track of the maximum score achievable up to each castle, considering whether the castle is captured or not, and how many warriors are left. This approach allows efficiently exploring all possible strategies while avoiding redundant calculations.",
